{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive, pixel-perfect custom "Operational Workflow Process" section based entirely on the visual layout, typography structure, and content shown in the reference images "image_5036db.png" and "image_5036c1.png".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Identity:** The section must automatically inherit the active Shopify theme's font variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`), standard section maximum layout width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container` wrappers), and native responsive side padding.
    - **Section Layout:** The section contains a left-aligned header group followed by a vertically stacked list of process cards. On desktop, each card features a horizontal split layout. On mobile viewports, the card layout collapses and elements stack vertically.
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with generous, clean padding at the top and bottom.
    
    ### 2. Section Header Group
    Left-aligned at the very top of the section with comfortable bottom margin separation:
    - **Eyebrow Tag:** "OPERATIONAL METHODOLOGY"
      - Styling: Small, uppercase letters, deep navy blue or dark olive-green text with subtle letter-spacing.
    - **Main Section Heading:** "How Flow Drives Transformation"
      - Styling: Large, exceptionally bold, deep navy blue text (#11243E).
    - **Introduction Subheading:** "A structured, data-driven methodology that embeds measurement directly into daily store routines and enterprise management."
      - Styling: Muted slate-gray text with comfortable line-height for elite scannability.
    
    ### 3. Repeatable Process Card Architecture (Modular Blocks)
    The workflow blocks must stack vertically with a uniform gap (approx. 24px) separating each card. Each step must be built as a repeatable block using a Liquid `{% for block in section.blocks %}` loop so more process blocks can be added, deleted, or reordered dynamically in the future.
    
    Each individual card container features:
    - **Card Background:** An ultra-soft, light gray or off-white background wash with smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 16px) and a very thin light-gray outer border stroke.
    - **Card Padding:** Deep, even internal padding to frame the content elements comfortably.
    - **Desktop Layout Grid:** Split horizontally into two clear structural zones:
      - **Left Meta Zone (approx. 25% width):** Vertically stacked alignment containing:
        - **Step Number:** A large, prominent, bold dark-navy numeral (e.g., "01", "02").
        - **Category Badge/Tag:** A small, uppercase text label inside a pill-shaped layout with a very faint light-gray background wash.
      - **Right Content Zone (approx. 75% width):** A vertical stack containing:
        - **Step Title:** Bold, crisp dark navy blue heading text (#11243E).
        - **Step Description:** A multi-line narrative paragraph in muted slate-gray text outlining the operational step details.
    
    ### 4. Exact Content Text Map for 100% Replication
    Ensure the default theme blocks perfectly transcribe all text strings from the references:
    
    #### BLOCK 1:
    - **Step Number:** 01
    - **Category Badge:** METHODOLOGY
    - **Step Title:** Establish Baseline Metrics
    - **Step Description:** Deploy Flow sensors to measure historical foot traffic, entry capture rates, and core conversion paths. Establish clean, objective baseline data before implementing organizational changes or frontend tactical experiments.
    
    #### BLOCK 2:
    - **Step Number:** 02
    - **Category Badge:** METHODOLOGY
    - **Step Title:** Democratize Performance Data
    - **Step Description:** Provide intuitive, real-time dashboard access to store managers and frontline staff. Shift data visibility away from corporate-only analysis, fostering individual store level accountability and immediate execution capability.
    
    #### BLOCK 3:
    - **Step Number:** 03
    - **Category Badge:** METHODOLOGY
    - **Step Title:** Run Structured Hypotheses
    - **Step Description:** Utilize precise traffic and dwell data to evaluate weekly promotional changes, visual merchandising strategies (VMD), and labor schedule adjustments. Measure exact behavioral variations against real baseline metrics.
    
    ### 5. Shopify Coding & Theme Schema Requirements
    - Make all titles, descriptions, step numbers, and badge labels completely dynamic and editable using structured block settings inside the Liquid schema architecture.
    - Wrap all custom styling selectors into a `<style>` block scoped directly to the unique section ID (`#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}`) to strictly enforce absolute zero style leakage across other pages.
    - Handle responsiveness cleanly: Ensure text drops down safely and containers scale fluidly without text overflowing or cutting off on narrow mobile viewports.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-workflow-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 80px 0;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-workflow-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .ai-workflow-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #11243E;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-workflow-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #677279;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-workflow-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 25% 75%;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai-workflow-card-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #11243E;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-workflow-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #677279;
    background-color: #f3f5f6;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-workflow-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #11243E;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-workflow-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #677279;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-workflow-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .ai-workflow-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 32px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-workflow-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 48px 0;
    }

    .ai-workflow-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 var(--spacing-4);
    }

    .ai-workflow-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 40px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .ai-workflow-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-workflow-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-workflow-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-workflow-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-workflow-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.eyebrow_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
      
      {% if block.settings.section_title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-workflow-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.section_title }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}
      
      {% if block.settings.section_subtitle != blank %}
        <p class="ai-workflow-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.section_subtitle }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-workflow-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.step_1_enabled %}
        <div class="ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-workflow-card-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_1_number != blank %}
              <div class="ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_1_number }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if block.settings.step_1_badge != blank %}
              <div class="ai-workflow-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_1_badge }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          <div class="ai-workflow-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_1_title != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_1_title }}
              </h3>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if block.settings.step_1_description != blank %}
              <p class="ai-workflow-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_1_description }}
              </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.step_2_enabled %}
        <div class="ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-workflow-card-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_2_number != blank %}
              <div class="ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_2_number }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if block.settings.step_2_badge != blank %}
              <div class="ai-workflow-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_2_badge }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          <div class="ai-workflow-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_2_title != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_2_title }}
              </h3>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if block.settings.step_2_description != blank %}
              <p class="ai-workflow-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_2_description }}
              </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.step_3_enabled %}
        <div class="ai-workflow-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-workflow-card-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_3_number != blank %}
              <div class="ai-workflow-step-number-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_3_number }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if block.settings.step_3_badge != blank %}
              <div class="ai-workflow-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_3_badge }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          <div class="ai-workflow-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_3_title != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-workflow-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_3_title }}
              </h3>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if block.settings.step_3_description != blank %}
              <p class="ai-workflow-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.step_3_description }}
              </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

